      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>Transporting a motorcycle from Salem to Chennai requires meticulous preparation to ensure a smooth, compliant, and secure journey. While the 250-kilometer route is relatively short, the administrative requirements remain strict.</p>
<p>Understanding and preparing the essential paperwork in advance prevents delays at loading hubs and protects your financial investment. This guide outlines the mandatory documents and the critical insurance coverage you must secure before your bike departs Salem.</p>

<h3>Mandatory Documentation Checklist</h3>
<p>Your vehicle’s legal identity and roadworthiness are verified through specific documents. Ensure the following items are ready and organized in a single file for the logistics team:</p>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
