    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">IBA-Approved Consignment Bilty:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">This is the most critical legal document for the shipment. The bilty, issued by the transport agency, acts as a contract of carriage. It details the route, the vehicle description, and the liability terms. Ensure the bilty is IBA (Indian Banks' Association) approved to comply with national transport regulations.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<h3>100% Declared-Value Marine Transit Insurance</h3>
<p>Standard vehicle insurance does not apply while the bike is on a transport truck. You must purchase specific marine transit insurance. We strongly recommend opting for <strong>100% declared-value coverage</strong>.</p>
<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">This policy ensures that if any damage, theft, or accident occurs during transit from Salem to Chennai, you are reimbursed for the full market value of your motorcycle as declared in the bilty.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Do not settle for partial coverage; full declared-value insurance provides complete peace of mind and financial security for your asset throughout the journey.</span></li></ul></div>
