			<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><p>Complete Protection:</p> Enclosed carriers offer the utmost protection for your bicycle as they are completely covered, shielding it from external elements.</span></li>
			<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><p>Flying Highway Stones:</p> Since the carrier is enclosed, flying highway stones are effectively blocked, minimizing the risk of scratches or damage to your bike.</span></li>
			<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><p>Rain, Dust, and Dirt:</p> Enclosed carriers provide a secure environment, keeping your bike free from rain, dust, and dirt that may accumulate during the journey.</span></li>
			<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><p>Vandalism:</p> Enclosed carriers diminish the chances of vandalism, ensuring your bike remains safe throughout the transportation process.</span></li>
			<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><p>Quality Services:</p> Enclosed carriers are usually associated with premium services, providing a higher level of care and attention to your bike.</span></li>
